DO NOT replace the design with a generic dashboard.
DO NOT change the overall layout, visual hierarchy, color mood, card style, glowing effects, typography style, navigation structure, spacing, or futuristic AI aesthetic.

Recreate the reference design as closely as technically possible while making every important element functional.

The final result must look like a premium real-world AI customer-support SaaS product, not a college-level static website.

==================================================
1. TECHNOLOGY STACK
==================================================

Frontend:
- React
- Vite
- React Router
- JavaScript
- Tailwind CSS or well-structured CSS
- Axios
- Context API where appropriate
- Recharts or another suitable chart library
- Lucide React / suitable icon library
- Web Speech API for voice commands

Backend:
- Node.js
- Express.js
- REST APIs
- JWT authentication
- bcrypt password hashing
- role-based authorization
- Socket.IO for real-time chat/notifications

Database:
- MongoDB
- Mongoose

Architecture:
frontend/
backend/

Keep frontend and backend clearly separated.

Create clean reusable components.
Do not put the entire application inside one huge component.

