15. VOICE CONTROL
==================================================

THIS IS A MAJOR FEATURE.

Implement voice control using the browser Web Speech API where supported.

There must also be normal mouse/touch/keyboard controls.

Voice button:

🎙️ Voice Assistant

States:

Listening...
Processing...
Command Executed

Support commands such as:

"Open dashboard"
"Go to my tickets"
"Create a new ticket"
"Show high priority tickets"
"Open ticket 1048"
"Go to live chat"
"Open AI triage"
"Open analytics"
"Open knowledge base"
"Open notifications"
"Go to profile"
"Logout"

Voice command should actually navigate or perform the appropriate action.

Do not claim voice functionality exists if the browser does not support it.
Show a friendly unsupported-browser message when required.

Ask for microphone permission only when the user activates voice control.

Never continuously listen without the user's action.

Provide a visible microphone state.

Also allow normal navigation at all times.

