35. DEVELOPMENT RULE
==================================================

I am a beginner.

Therefore, do not simply dump thousands of files at once.

Build the application in phases.

PHASE 1:
Project setup + frontend design system + navbar + Home page

PHASE 2:
Login/Register + authentication + MongoDB

PHASE 3:
Customer dashboard + ticket system

PHASE 4:
AI Triage + AI Draft + Human Approval

PHASE 5:
Agent Dashboard + Live Chat + Socket.IO

PHASE 6:
Voice Control

PHASE 7:
Supervisor Analytics + Knowledge Base + CSAT

PHASE 8:
Admin + Notifications + Security

PHASE 9:
Testing + bug fixing + final UI polish

After every phase:
- explain what was created
- list files changed
- give exact terminal commands
- tell me exactly where each file belongs
- tell me how to run frontend and backend
- check for errors before moving to the next phase

Do not move to the next phase until the current phase is working.

START WITH PHASE 1 ONLY.


